com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqzKtzdwII3h6Nd2U-DnCbHqTa75W0AqXmSzi_06cosw&oe=6AFF2866"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "39775245362089294", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827601_39775245382089292_5759835075749763163_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h2J9mdmWN7AQ7kNvwHzos8X&_nc_oc=Adouy2GmNhkL2_VaZYskC0zTSOBgCXwpqC641TS94yvhizay4sx4pxDBwiLyiOuBlyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBvsvzzTSAbtm7OIDTpQqcQ8NqVhBXNj1uDg_payqCgA&oe=6AFF0A26"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HomeWalk", "keywords": ["walking", "treadmill", "fitness", "exercise", "steps"], "long_description": "No treadmill? Walk your home.\n\nHomeWalk reads your Quest's Space Setup, plans a loop of long, straight lines around your furniture and lays a light path on your real floor. You see your home the whole time, in passthrough.\n\nWhile you walk, a screen stays in front of you: a simple browser with six tiles for the sites you choose, for shows, podcasts, news or your inbox. Time, distance, speed, step and calorie estimates are on screen, with a chime at every kilometer (or mile). Levels, badges, daily goals and a streak keep you coming back. No controllers needed.\n\nOptional leaderboards under a nickname, no sign-up. No ads, no tracking, and your room scan never leaves the headset.\n\nEarly Access: HomeWalk works today from the first step to the summary, and we're shaping the rest with you. Free during Early Access.\n\nSafety: clear the floor, walk rather than run, and watch your surroundings. Steps and calories are estimates.", "short_description": "No treadmill? Walk your home. A light path loops around your furniture while you watch your shows, catch up on news or answer email."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://homewalk.zurlabs.org/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ZurLabs", "support_webs